  battleScreen: {fileID: 0}
  element: 
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 0
  battleCanvas: {fileID: 0}
  eventSystem: {fileID: 0}
  initalLines:
  - Hey there, welcome in.
  - "When working with fire, it\u2019s important to not be in a rush, keeping proper
    control, recognizing where fire has been and where it will be."
  - Go try out the fireball simulator.
  - Careful not to get burned.
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - 'Good, you kept up well. '
  - "Now let\u2019s see that in practical application."
  afterBattleLines:
  - Well done.
  - "Now I\u2019m confident you can handle fire responsibly."
  - I believe you will pick this up rather quickly.
  afterSpellLines:
  - Wonderful!
  - Remember to take lots of pictures during your time here.
